# Devices: Bluetooth (with sound over Bluetooth), printing (driverless IPP; ipp-usb for USB printers).
# Drives and shares: udisks2 + gvfs mount USB sticks, cards and phones (MTP); gvfs-backends is the Windows/SMB, SFTP and FTP side of
# Explorer's Network; gvfs-fuse shows mounts as plain paths; lsof lets gvfs name the program that blocks an eject.
udisks2 gvfs gvfs-backends gvfs-fuse lsof
